  "evidence": [
    "Pinned get_player_color 0x47B380 reads 0x93D4F8: existing AlphaNet player_count_ at NetDaemonNet+0x768. Preserve each reload.",
    "Pinned config_players 0x481E90 clears 0x90E778 and 0x90E79C; draw_session_info reads those and 0x90E8E3. Existing session mode_, scenario_text_wire_tail_ and options time_control_ own these addresses. No new buffer capacity or ninth-row interpretation.",
    "Pinned draw_custom_rules reads rule words 0x90E8EC/F0/F4; gate at 0x93E8C0 is existing NetDaemon primary_state_.leading_words_[0]. Preserve all read/write/callback order and quirks.",
    "No header/layout changes. Correct stale alias-owner commentary, update actual-source fixtures without weakening behavior or mutation assertions, and add direct-member/read-timing controls. Full owner measurements and build/link required."
  ],
  "intent": "Replace eight artificial pointer aliases with existing source-owned NetWin session and NetDaemon fields, preserving individual reads and original behavior.",
